        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "1. Add potassium tartrate and sodium carbonate to a beaker with water.\n2. turn on the heater until the solution becomes clear.\n3. remove the impurities in the clear solution using filter paper and pour the filtered solution into a container and wait for it to crystallize.\n4. Strike the crystallized piezoelectric element and see if it generates electricity.\n5. Assemble the piezoelectric element onto a piezoelectric plate.\n6. Try tapping the piezoelectric plate with a hammer or hitting it with a ball to turn on the lantern and charge the battery.",
